{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_6_level_st_06-03","groupId":"main_6","stageId":"st_06-03","title":"只有你知道","storyCode":"6-18","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_st_06-03.txt","sourceHash":"a80982aec165f6148801e7f4a1ab48c697d497e2012c181bcdf3bc6a4d50647f","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_uptown_2"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_outcity_1"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_f"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_n"},{"type":"narration","text":"龍門保衛行動已經結束。重複一遍，龍門保衛行動已經結束。\n請警員清點裝備，返還各署，於一個工作日內歸隊。\n請近衛局成員與自己的小隊會合，前往近衛局等候下一步命令。\n再重述一遍......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你在這裡幹什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......你那是什麼表情？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"沒、沒什麼呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"停下。你要去哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"去看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"不用看了，我查過了，沒什麼東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"陳，沒必要了。戰鬥已經結束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"請你讓一讓，Miss.詩懷雅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"你已經阻止了整合運動，甚至是特殊部隊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"你讓他們同時曝光在近衛局、羅德島，甚至是監察司面前！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"你已經阻止他們了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"讓開！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"你作為特別督查組組長，已經做得夠好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"不要再查下去了！你想知道什麼？沒有什麼好知道的了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我要知道發生了什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"這個排水系統，你知道意味著什麼嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"現在你做的一切已經夠可以了，再踏出一步，你就會走向龍門反面！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"我們完全可以讓龍門變得更好，我們重新建設，我們去把過去的那些東西全都清除掉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，陳，別下去，不要看！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"正義感，責任感，歸屬感，每一種你都達到了，你這次真是幹得無懈可擊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"阿陳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"讓開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"你是這樣的人，所以你不能看！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"有人和你說了，“不要去查排水系統”，對吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"有人和我說了一樣的話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"那你為什麼還要查下去！沒有人希望你看到這些的，沒有！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"龍門城希望我看見。我是這樣的人，所以我必須要看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"詩懷雅。不要逼我拔劍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"這是什麼味道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"這......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"..................."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_f"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，你上來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"敵人的指揮官，叫做梅菲斯特的感染者，抓住了嗎？"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"不關你事。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"這......你說什麼？你這是合作的態度嗎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼回事，你們羅德島不是追下去了嗎？"}]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"......能給個準確的說法嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"我們是要交差的，而且，沒擊殺掉敵方的指揮官的話......"}]},{"label":"已經死了。","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"死了？怎麼死的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"你確定？只有結晶死亡鑑定和解剖才能確定感染者的身份，礦石病會抹消初級的生物資訊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"這些你不會不懂吧？"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？等等，你去哪？你抱著的是誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"......下面究竟發生什麼事了？"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"死了一個感染者。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_f"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"整合運動的殘餘小隊，應該已經成功撤退了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道這算不算白毛兔子想要的戰果......雖然最後的她應該已經不在乎這個了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"不管怎麼樣，她做到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"白毛兔子......你可真倔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"“贏得漂亮”？贏個鬼啊......你要不是快死掉了，我們現在已經是一地冰碎了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是活下來了嗎？你也得到了寶貴的戰鬥經驗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"經驗增長只會在以後才凸顯作用。死在面前的人是回不來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"我本來可以救下她的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭已經去找龍門的負責人了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"是吧，大概。交給她們就好，我不關心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"灰喉，搭把手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"你是不是在作弄我？我什麼情況你難道看不出？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"你是站不起來了嗎？我看你氣色很好啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"......灰喉幹員，能不能請你扶我起來，我失血過多而且全身失溫，雖然看起來我完好無損但我快要死了麻煩你趕緊扶我回本艦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"哦......對。算了，不麻煩你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是要離開羅德島嗎？沒必要勉強自己再為羅德島工作了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"......為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"經歷了剛才那場戰鬥，我已經感受到了感染者的痛苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"那比我們身邊發生的事情，更令人沮喪，也更無奈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"我理解了感染者的痛苦，我覺得我們可以阻止這些事情發生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"我懷疑你看過的悲劇太少了。灰喉，說說，你我有什麼不同？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"你是感染者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"如果剛剛我們真的戰死了，還分什麼普通人和感染者？只不過是幾個人簡單地死掉了而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"有的人在乎自己是神民還是先民，有的人在意自己出身的國家，有的人重視種族血統，也有的人看重財產......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"作為一個感染者，我從來沒對別人說過“我過的比人慘”、“感染者一直在被壓迫”這種廢話。沒人愛聽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"這座貧民窟裡，你看見的每一個人，無論感染者還是非感染者，沒人願意聽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"痛苦並沒有程度上的區別，我只是希望感染者的這種痛苦能被正視而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"“感染者也是人”，就這麼簡單。我想要的不是看小動物一樣的憐憫眼光，我個人爭取的是一種平視。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"屠殺、隔離、囚禁、苦役，我什麼都見過了，卻不知道該拿出些什麼出來，才能對它們全都說“不”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"白毛兔子做到了我做不到的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"我見識到了真正的垂死掙扎......即使只剩下一丁點時間，她也要向我們展示的那種恐怖。這種堅毅足夠超越任何身份了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"現在就算讓我去跟龍門那些無血無淚的黑雨披幹一架都沒問題。畢竟比起這隻白兔子，他們也不過如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"真的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"我說說的，會死的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，為了自己的信念奮戰至死，真是不錯的結局。算是我的人生理想之一了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"......你見到這兩個人現在這種樣子了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}和阿米婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"博士要去哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"去羅德島安葬白兔子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，說是安葬，其實只是處理屍體，防止她的結晶粉塵化，造成二次感染。我們感染者總要走那麼一遭的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"至少，作為一個羅德島幹員，我已經開始信任博士了。灰喉，你看到Dr.{@nickname}的眼神了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"就是這個，這個眼神，讓我覺得自己可以信任這個人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"我看見了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"......我覺得，還是阿米婭現在的眼神更可怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"因為這兩人要去的地方是不一樣的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}走向了感染者的焚爐，而阿米婭要去龍門，這座感染者新的墓場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"我總算明白為什麼Ace說Dr.{@nickname}和阿米婭、凱爾希一樣神奇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"那凱爾希在哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希會在她該在的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，走吧。既然你不準備離開羅德島，那我再求你一次，拉我起來吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"你為什麼不等醫療幹員過來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"因為我現在這副樣子真的很衰。精英幹員......得看起來更堅強些才行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"......死要面子活受罪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"這時候就別把傷人的話拿出來隨口說了好嗎......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，我們的隨行醫療幹員是誰你知道嗎，不是別人，正是嘉維爾，是嘉維爾啊，她剛才說洗洗手就來，馬上就來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"你喜不喜歡被血濺一臉的感覺？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"手給我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"血的話，我不喜歡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們就得走快點......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"對了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我沒救那兩個感染者孩子，你也不會救我，我就不會有機會改變對感染者的看法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"這也是感染者給我的啟示。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"......你又搞錯了啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"那和我救你又有什麼關係？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"narration","text":"龍門上城區 行政長官辦事處"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您好。我與魏先生有約，麻煩您幫我帶路了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"接待員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊，魏長官上一場會面正好剛剛結束，請這邊走，小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"接待員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃......您是......."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭。感染者阿米婭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_o"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_040","isRemote":false,"text":"我等就此先行告退。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒼老的男聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不送。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_041","isRemote":false,"text":"感覺怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_040","isRemote":false,"text":"已見他雷霆手段。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"監察司","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"表面上看起來不過爾爾，實際上，你知我知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_041","isRemote":false,"text":"他們這種人總這樣。我是能理解為什麼鎮守龍門的是他了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_041","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_041","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者？怎麼在這？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"接待員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊，貴客請別見怪，這位也是有求於魏先生......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我並沒有什麼事是想求魏先生的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"接待員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（阿米婭小姐，至少先避一避......！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_041","isRemote":false,"text":"你這身衣服......是與龍門合作的羅德島吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_041","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者別在這停留太長時間。龍門，可是會吃人的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你的提醒。不過這片大地吃人的時候從不挑食。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_041","isRemote":false,"text":"哦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_041","isRemote":false,"text":"那我也該謝謝你的提醒。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_041","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_041","isRemote":false,"text":"知道她的身份嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"監察司","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你又在打什麼算盤？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"魏先生。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"哦......阿米婭小姐，我猜你會來。作戰很成功，羅德島功不可沒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來，龍門會履行合約上的義務，為羅德島提供必要的商業援助，以及其他......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"不用了，魏先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是來解除合約的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島有那麼記恨誘敵深入的策略嗎？如果我的所作所為有任何不當之處，你都可以提出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"我會向你誠摯道歉，阿米婭小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"魏先生你一直表現得很有禮節，每次都讓我有些不知所措。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"但我已經看到你的武裝力量和你的計畫了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"不要過度解讀戰局，阿米婭小姐。這不是一項指控吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"不是的，魏先生。我沒有權力指控你。我只是單純來辦理之後的手續的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼要解除合約？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"因為我判斷與龍門之間的合作關係並不適合羅德島。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"互惠互利，這難道對於一家企業而言還不夠好？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"即使是企業，也有它的發展方向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，你是認為在貴司感染者的一面，龍門有所虧欠？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"也不是。羅德島從來就沒有所謂“感染者”的那一面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島不是單純在為了感染者戰鬥的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我不只是個感染者......我還是這片大地的一員。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我們羅德島是解決感染者問題的專家，這是因為我們許多幹員都身為感染者，對感染者的遭遇和環境瞭若指掌——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"但想讓這片大地擺脫礦石病的陰霾，從不意味著我們只為了感染者而戰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"魏先生，如果你覺得我們只是個具備一定武力條件，單純而稚嫩的感染者權益組織......我會為此感到遺憾。這是個誤解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我們羅德島，不分你們、我們或者他們，是為了這片大地上的所有人而戰鬥的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"龍門並不需要我們的幫助。現在解除合約，羅德島也會就此退出龍門。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島也已經完成了應盡的義務，所以合約中止後，其他附加條件也一併失效，這是合約上的白紙黑字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島大可把龍門分享的利益當做一種饋贈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"不必了，魏先生。比起這些“利益”，我們羅德島更看重合作方的行事方式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"魏先生一開始就把我們當做一顆棋子。現在，這顆棋子證明了它的價值，我們的退出理應也在你的計畫之中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，魏先生......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"請說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"如果被蒙蔽的只是羅德島，我不會中止這份合約。雖然聽起來奇怪，但我能理解合作方的不信任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，龍門隱瞞真相的對象，並不只有我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"近衛局，龍門市民，貧民區的感染者......他們並不知道埋藏在整件事背後的灰暗手段。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽說阿米婭小姐能讀心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"魏先生可以當我不能，也可以假定我能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"我還是可以把你的推測當作一種提醒而非詰難，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我不會指謫龍門的策略和未來規劃，魏先生。可我有權阻止我的幹員們參與其中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"魏先生，無論是羅德島的幹員還是整合運動的一份子，是切爾諾伯格的流亡者還是龍門市的市民......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"他們都是活生生的人。被自己不知道的事情左右著生命，我不認為這是件理所應當的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"我卻認為，發揮作用，遠比是否認識到自己的作用更重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......不。不該這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"有些事情對於魏先生而言......也許太平常了。就像對於普通人來說，感染者隔離也是件稀疏平常，不值得議論的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"但，不管這樣的事情有多“平常”，也不該被當做一件“正常”的事去看待。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"因為一件事在我們面前發生過太多次，所以我們就對它習以為常......？從來就沒有這種道理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"否則，即使我們消滅了礦石病，爭端也不會減少、平息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"這只能讓被利用、被關押的換成另外一批人......僅僅不再是“感染者”而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"這是你的訴求......還是你的理想？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"這是我的準則。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"魏先生，有一句話，我必須要說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"——活人是不應該成為棋子的。人就是人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"你會下圍棋嗎，阿米婭小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"魏先生......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"你是黑子，還是白子？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"魏彥吾，你都做了什麼？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"陳警官，我有客人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"陳警官？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你都做了什麼？是不是你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"不，只能是你......只可能是你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"那隻老鼠和她狡猾的父親充其量只是你的一點小手段，敢下令的只有你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我原以為只要戰勝整合運動，只要重新團結起所有的龍門人，我們就終歸能度過這個難關，甚至是解開龍門人之間的誤會......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒想到。我早該想到的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你在這時候重申了自己的身份，自己作為龍門主人的身份。你從來都是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"即使這樣，即使這樣......你怎麼能做出這種事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是能除去所有阻礙嗎？你不是能燒掉所有路上的荊棘嗎？究竟是什麼逼你低了頭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你們所有人對感染者的態度，但為什麼，為什麼......那可不只是......不只是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你甚至不敢為自己的行為負責。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"抹去名字，抹去蹤跡，抹去命令，遮掩住你所有的行跡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"魏彥吾，林和你的種族應該對換一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"信口開河。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"陳警司，我不知道你指的是什麼，希望你的解釋能讓我信服。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"好，那我開門見山地說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"是不是你殺了塔露拉的父親？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......陳警官？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"是不是你逼我們的母親嫁給那個懦弱的男人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"是誰向你灌輸這些的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你要猜猜看嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"請注意自己的語氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"掌控了龍門一切的魏大人突然發現，自己掩藏多年的秘密，竟然早就不是什麼秘密了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"陳警官，不要逾矩。侍衛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"是塔露拉告訴我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，塔露拉所知道的一切，本來就沒幾個人知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你會惱怒，只是因為你發現這可能會再次威脅到你的統治......那個老頭，那個科西切公爵，從始至終就是你的噩夢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"而你對塔露拉從來都沒有過哪怕一點點歉意，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"陳警官，不要揣測你沒有權限瞭解的事實，也不要輕信來源不明的訊息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"你很累了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我當然不會相信那個公爵老頭！他差點毀掉了整座龍門，也就是他擄走了塔露拉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"可我記得很清楚......那天是個晴天。那天晚上，沒有月亮，只有幾顆星星。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"老頭抓著塔露拉，站在斷橋的那一邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"而你的背後......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你的背後，站滿了穿著黑色雨披的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我相信塔露拉。我一直相信她。雖然我也覺得，她可能會被謊言蒙蔽，但你也的確就是這種人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你不就是那種為了自己的目的什麼都可以犧牲的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"陳暉潔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你想清掃整個貧民區，甚至是摧毀貧民區！那麼多龍門人，那麼多信賴著我們的龍門人，那麼多支持著我們走到現在的龍門人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"因為感染者不算龍門市民？因為他們沒能力融進你的高樓大廈？還是因為貧民窟的他們也有人性，也有一天會和感染者和平相處"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你真的在保護龍門嗎？難道你不才是那個威脅著龍門生息的人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"不要以為有幾隻老鼠在你面前擋著，你就能完全脫開關係！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......沒有你的允許，姓林的根本就不敢這麼做！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"陳小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"你對我為龍門所做的一切......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"幾近一無所知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"一直以來，你最讓我討厭的部分，就是你這種把所有事情都捏在自己手裡的態度。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"如果兩位現在還有哪怕一絲空閒時間的話，我想請兩位聽聽一條訊息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希醫生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"看終端。具體已經發給你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"我不記得自己允許過你在這個時候進入我的私人會客室，羅德島的醫生。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"我讓她進來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"多少年了，你怎麼還這個樣子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼都瞞著她，什麼都自己來，你不累嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"聽這位客人說吧。同樣的消息我們也接到了，你原本可以早三分鐘知道的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，凱爾希醫生，請說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"在我們剿滅龍門城內整合運動的時候，敵人的最高指揮官並沒有出現。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"原因很簡單，因為她一直在切爾諾伯格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"她看著我們或者氣定神閒或者焦頭爛額......反正沒有把足夠的注意力放在她身上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_6_12"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"而現在，切爾諾伯格的一部分，準確來說，是它的核心城......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"正在接近龍門。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"再過三十六個小時，切爾諾伯格核心城就會與龍門相撞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"蠅頭小事。龍門不乏抵禦移動城市與軍艦的手段，區區一座核心城不足為懼，我們甚至不用......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"您意識到了，魏長官？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......它是不是開始......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"不間斷地發送自己的城邦認證碼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯，您的直覺，或者說推測，是正確的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"核心城正不斷向各處發送認證碼，龍門全城都已經收到了電波。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"它宣稱——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"“這座城市是烏薩斯的領土。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_ep06"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米婭"]},{"speakerId":"char_003_kalts","aliases":["凱爾希"]},{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["阿米婭","陳"]},{"speakerId":"char_015_lmg","aliases":["近衛局成員"]},{"speakerId":"char_017_homura","aliases":["煌"]},{"speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","aliases":["魏彥吾"]},{"speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","aliases":["文月"]},{"speakerId":"char_308_swire","aliases":["詩懷雅"]},{"speakerId":"char_367_swllow","aliases":["灰喉"]}]}
